{"step_index":47,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T16:54:10Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-23T22:24:10+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-08-23T22:24:10+05:30\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/renu5/Downloads/find-skill-repo/all%20github%20repos/findskill/README.md`\nTotal Lines: 126\nTotal Bytes: 3679\nShowing lines 1 to 126\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: [English](./README.md) | [中文](./README_CN.md)\r\n2: \r\n3: # find-skills (Windows Compatible Fork)\r\n4: \r\n5: <div align=\"center\">\r\n6: \r\n7: ![GitHub stars](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/KimYx0207/findskill?style=social)\r\n8: ![GitHub forks](https://img.shields.io/github/forks/KimYx0207/findskill?style=social)\r\n9: ![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-blue.svg)\r\n10: \r\n11: **Windows 兼容版 Claude Code 技能搜索工具**\r\n12: \r\n13: </div>\r\n14: \r\n15: > 🔗 **GitHub仓库**：[https://github.com/KimYx0207/findskill](https://github.com/KimYx0207/findskill)\r\n16: \r\n17: > 老金的开源知识库，实时更新群二维码：https://my.feishu.cn/wiki/OhQ8wqntFihcI1kWVDlcNdpznFf\r\n18: \r\n19: ---\r\n20: \r\n21: ## 📞 联系方式\r\n22: \r\n23: <div align=\"center\">\r\n24:   <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KimYx0207/Claude-Code-x-OpenClaw-Guide-Zh/main/images/二维码基础款.png\" alt=\"联系方式\" width=\"600\"/>\r\n25:   <p><strong>获取更多AI资讯和技术支持</strong></p>\r\n26:   <p>\r\n27:     🌐 <a href=\"https://www.aiking.dev/\">aiking.dev</a>\r\n28:   </p>\r\n29: </div>\r\n30: \r\n31: ---\r\n32: \r\n33: [中文文档](./README_CN.md)\r\n34: \r\n35: A Windows-compatible fork of [vercel-labs/skills find-skills](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) that fixes the empty output issue in Claude Code on Windows.\r\n36: \r\n37: ## The Problem\r\n38: \r\n39: On Windows, Claude Code uses a Bash/Git Bash environment that doesn't properly handle `npx skills` commands - they return empty output silently.\r\n40: \r\n41: ```bash\r\n42: # ❌ This returns nothing on Windows in Claude Code\r\n43: npx skills find \"react\"\r\n44: ```\r\n45: \r\n46: ## The Solution\r\n47: \r\n48: This fork modifies the SKILL.md to instruct Claude Code to use PowerShell for running skills commands:\r\n49: \r\n50: ```bash\r\n51: # ✅ This works on Windows\r\n52: powershell -Command \"npx skills find 'react'\"\r\n53: ```\r\n54: \r\n55: ## Installation\r\n56: \r\n57: ### Step 1: Install the original find-skills\r\n58: \r\n59: ```bash\r\n60: npx skills add vercel-labs/skills@find-skills -g -y\r\n61: ```\r\n62: \r\n63: ### Step 2: Replace with Windows version\r\n64: \r\n65: 1. Open: https://github.com/KimYx0207/findskill/blob/main/windows/SKILL.md\r\n66: 2. Copy all content\r\n67: 3. Replace the file at:\r\n68:    ```\r\n69:    C:\\Users\\<YourUsername>\\.agents\\skills\\find-skills\\SKILL.md\r\n70:    ```\r\n71: \r\n72: ### Step 3: Restart Claude Code\r\n73: \r\n74: Close and reopen Claude Code.\r\n75: \r\n76: ### Step 4: Verify\r\n77: \r\n78: Say to Claude Code: \"find a skill for data analysis\"\r\n79: \r\n80: If you see search results, installation is successful.\r\n81: \r\n82: ## Files\r\n83: \r\n84: ```\r\n85: findskill/\r\n86: ├── README.md           # English documentation (this file)\r\n87: ├── README_CN.md        # Chinese documentation\r\n88: ├── LICENSE             # MIT License\r\n89: ├── original/\r\n90: │   └── SKILL.md        # Original version from vercel-labs\r\n91: └── windows/\r\n92:     └── SKILL.md        # Windows-compatible version\r\n93: ```\r\n94: \r\n95: ## Key Changes\r\n96: \r\n97: 1. **Added Windows compatibility warning** at the top\r\n98: 2. **Changed all commands** to use `powershell -Command \"...\"` format\r\n99: 3. **Added Chinese to English keyword reference** (search only supports English)\r\n100: 4. **Added troubleshooting section**\r\n101: \r\n102: ## Usage\r\n103: \r\n104: After installation, ask Claude Code:\r\n105: \r\n106: - \"find a skill for react\"\r\n107: - \"is there a skill for code review\"\r\n108: - \"search skill for data analysis\"\r\n109: \r\n110: Claude Code will now correctly use PowerShell to run the search.\r\n111: \r\n112: ## Known Limitations\r\n113: \r\n114: 1. **Search only supports English keywords** - Chinese queries need to be translated by AI\r\n115: 2. **Trigger is semantic** - AI may or may not trigger find-skills depending on how you phrase it. Adding \"skill\" to your request makes it more reliable.\r\n116: 3. **Windows only** - macOS/Linux users should use the original version\r\n117: \r\n118: ## Credits\r\n119: \r\n120: - Original skill: [vercel-labs/skills](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills)\r\n121: - Windows fix: [@KimYx0207](https://github.com/KimYx0207)\r\n122: \r\n123: ## License\r\n124: \r\n125: MIT (same as original)\r\n126: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
